<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>

  <meta charset="UTF-8">

  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Clue 5 - The Library</title>

  <style>

    body {

      background-color: #111;

      color: #f5f5f5;

      font-family: Georgia, serif;

      text-align: center;

      margin: 0;

      padding: 25px;

    }

    .clue-box {

      max-width: 600px;

      margin: auto;

      background-color: #1c1c1c;

      border: 3px solid #8b0000;

      border-radius: 15px;

      padding: 30px 20px;

      box-shadow: 0 0 20px #8b0000;

    }

    h1 {

      color: #c62828;

      font-size: 38px;

      margin-bottom: 5px;

    }

    h2 {

      color: #d4af37;

    }

    .story {

      font-size: 20px;

      line-height: 1.6;

    }

    .evidence {

      margin: 25px 0;

      padding: 20px;

      background-color: #292929;

      border-left: 5px solid #d4af37;

    }

    .notes {

      color: #d4af37;

      font-size: 19px;

      margin-top: 25px;

    }

    .next {

      display: inline-block;

      margin-top: 25px;

      padding: 15px 25px;

      background-color: #8b0000;

      color: white;

      border-radius: 8px;

      font-weight: bold;

      font-size: 18px;

    }

  </style>

</head>

<body>

  <div class="clue-box">

    <h1>🔎 CLUE 5</h1>

    <h2>THE LIBRARY</h2>

    <div class="story">

      <p><strong>Someone was searching for something...</strong></p>

      <p>

        Several books have been pulled from the shelves,

        but one thing catches your attention.

      </p>

      <div class="evidence">

        Behind a row of books, investigators discover a

        <strong>CANDLESTICK</strong> wrapped in a cloth.

      </div>

      <p>

        There are no fingerprints.

        <br><br>

        Someone made sure of that.

      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="notes">

      📝 DETECTIVE NOTES<br><br>

      ROOM: LIBRARY<br>

      WEAPON: CANDLESTICK

    </div>

    <p>

      <strong>

        Every clue eliminates a possibility.

        Keep track of what you find.

      </strong>

    </p>

    <div class="next">

      🔎 FIND CLUE 6

    </div>

  </div>

</body>

</html>
